    <briefdescription>
<para>Saves strings in the provided stable storage and returns a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_ref" kindref="compound">StringRef</ref> with a stable character pointer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Saving the same string yields the same <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_ref" kindref="compound">StringRef</ref>.</para>
<para>Compared to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_saver" kindref="compound">StringSaver</ref>, it does more work but avoids saving the same string multiple times.</para>
<para>Compared to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1dwarf__linker_1_1_string_pool" kindref="compound">StringPool</ref>, it performs fewer allocations but doesn&apos;t support refcounting/deletion. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
